    },
    {
      "page_id": "p02",
      "text": "A baby laughs months before it talks. A nurse can weigh that baby, though nobody can weigh its laugh.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_099/pages/p02.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/pages/p02.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8411,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/song/p02.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9822
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p03",
      "text": "Laughter is catching. One laugh sets off the next, though nobody knows why.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_099/pages/p03.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/pages/p03.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7026,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/song/p03.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7679
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p04",
      "text": "Tickle a rat and it laughs, but the laugh is too high to hear.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_099/pages/p04.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/pages/p04.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 4884,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 6138
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "Tickle yourself, though, and no laugh comes: your own hand is not shock enough.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_099/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6817,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7157
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "A long laugh is tough work: it pumps the ribs enough to leave you sore.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_099/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6399,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7157
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "Laugh long enough and a cough turns up. A cough and a laugh are the same rough blast of air.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_099/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8829,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9351
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "No two laughs match: a rough snort, a wheeze, a honk, a laugh with no sound.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_099/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8202,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8986
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "A real laugh is rough. A fake laugh is too smooth, and faking one is tough.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_099/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7470,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_099/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7993
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p10",
      "text": "A laugh is free. Nobody can weigh one, and eight a day is not enough.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_099/pages/p10.webp",
